WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 15]

01:34.560 --> 01:38.620
Is it wrong
that I gave away my own things?

01:38.640 --> 01:40.839
I don't have a say in this.

01:40.920 --> 01:45.099
The thing is, the court
is investigating corruption

01:45.119 --> 01:47.820
to preserve clear governance
and strengthen law enforcement.

01:47.840 --> 01:49.600
At this point,

01:49.800 --> 01:52.080
I wouldn't dare to accept gifts.

01:52.840 --> 01:54.119
Your Majesty,

01:55.159 --> 01:56.880
may I explain myself?

02:06.720 --> 02:08.119
Your Majesty,

02:09.239 --> 02:10.379
do these accessories

02:10.399 --> 02:12.799
look familiar to you?

02:12.959 --> 02:16.052
Your Majesty, you rewarded them to me.

02:16.072 --> 02:17.379
Although I didn't do much,

02:17.399 --> 02:20.140
Your Majesty, you always
rewarded me handsomely.

02:20.160 --> 02:23.320
I'm truly grateful to you.

02:23.679 --> 02:24.900
But I fear as well.

02:24.920 --> 02:27.959
You took the rewards I gave you
and gave them to someone else.

02:28.160 --> 02:29.499
What do you mean by this?

02:29.519 --> 02:31.079
He's my junior after all.

02:32.399 --> 02:35.000
I dare not give him inferior gifts.

02:39.030 --> 02:40.539
What about Chen's Manor, then?

02:40.559 --> 02:42.099
I'm just living there temporarily.

02:42.119 --> 02:43.379
The title deed isn't under your name?

02:43.399 --> 02:44.460
No.

02:44.480 --> 02:46.640
Your Majesty, such a scheme
is pretty common.

02:46.640 --> 02:48.160
Some people don't write their names
on their title deeds.

02:48.160 --> 02:50.300
They'd say that they were
renting or borrowing it.

02:50.320 --> 02:52.460
But it's hard to say
if we keep investigating it.

02:52.480 --> 02:54.979
Mr. Chen, can you explain to us

02:54.999 --> 02:56.639
who you borrowed Chen's Manor from?

02:57.070 --> 02:58.919
It's a property of the imperial family.

02:59.239 --> 03:00.560
His Majesty

03:01.320 --> 03:03.020
allowed me to stay there temporarily.

03:03.040 --> 03:05.699
I do have some savings as well.

03:05.719 --> 03:08.199
You may check all the sources

03:08.519 --> 03:10.000
of my savings as well.

03:11.760 --> 03:13.659
Fan Xian, are you happy now?

03:13.679 --> 03:16.560
Yes, Your Majesty. I'm done.

03:23.399 --> 03:24.340
Lai Mingcheng.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.440
Your Majesty.

03:27.760 --> 03:30.759
What charges are you accusing
Fan Jian and his son of?

03:32.371 --> 03:33.519
Your Majesty,

03:33.679 --> 03:36.140
the Fan family is involved
in the case of Baoyue Pleasure House.

03:36.160 --> 03:37.580
As court officials,

03:37.600 --> 03:40.290
it doesn't make sense
for them to operate a brothel.

03:40.310 --> 03:42.119
The Fan family failed
to educate their child well.

03:42.119 --> 03:43.710
The reputation of court officials
has been damaged.

03:43.719 --> 03:46.680
Fan Jian and his son
should be held accountable for it.

03:48.080 --> 03:50.799
I think someone died as well.

03:51.279 --> 03:52.060
Your Majesty,

03:52.080 --> 03:55.379
Second Prince is involved
in the murder case.

03:55.399 --> 03:58.400
I wish to go through them one by one.

03:59.439 --> 04:00.519
Fan Jian.

04:01.910 --> 04:02.819
Yes, Your Majesty.

04:02.839 --> 04:03.979
What do you have to say?

04:03.999 --> 04:05.199
Your Majesty,

04:05.999 --> 04:08.819
my second son, Fan Sizhe,
was stubborn and foolish.

04:08.839 --> 04:09.939
He was duped.

04:09.959 --> 04:11.740
He's indeed the owner
of Baoyue Pleasure House.

04:11.760 --> 04:13.880
I failed to educate my son well.

04:13.890 --> 04:14.980
I have nothing to say about that.

04:14.999 --> 04:15.999
Luckily, my foolish son

04:15.999 --> 04:17.140
turned back before it was too late.

04:17.160 --> 04:18.230
He deeply regretted his action.

04:18.239 --> 04:20.099
He sealed off
Baoyue Pleasure House long ago.

04:20.119 --> 04:22.260
I've also punished him
according to our family law

04:22.280 --> 04:23.900
and chased him out of the Capital.

04:23.920 --> 04:25.619
He is to head to a barren land

04:25.639 --> 04:26.900
to train his body and mind.

04:26.920 --> 04:28.580
National laws come first!

04:28.600 --> 04:29.940
Family rules come after that!

04:29.960 --> 04:33.460
My foolish son, Fan Sizhe,
isn't a court official.

04:33.480 --> 04:35.959
Although it was inappropriate
of him to operate a brothel,

04:36.040 --> 04:38.320
he didn't actually break the law.

04:38.999 --> 04:40.680
If that's the case,

04:41.079 --> 04:43.340
all the court officials here

04:43.360 --> 04:45.260
have their own families

04:45.280 --> 04:46.659
and relatives.

04:46.679 --> 04:48.979
If all of them do what they desire

04:48.999 --> 04:50.040
and exploit their positions

04:50.040 --> 04:51.319
for personal gains,

04:51.319 --> 04:54.159
the dignity of Qing State's
imperial court will cease to exist!

04:54.720 --> 04:55.800
Your Majesty,

04:55.879 --> 04:57.739
Fan Jian is his father

04:57.759 --> 05:00.040
while Fan Xian is his eldest brother.

05:00.199 --> 05:03.419
Both of them should be
held accountable for this.

05:03.439 --> 05:05.530
How do you think
they should be held accountable, then?

05:05.550 --> 05:07.790
They should be demoted
and severely reprimanded!

05:16.840 --> 05:18.079
Prime Minister Lin.

05:21.559 --> 05:22.739
Your Majesty.

05:22.759 --> 05:23.739
What do you think?

05:23.759 --> 05:26.179
I don't understand.

05:26.199 --> 05:29.859
Didn't a murder occur
in Baoyue Pleasure House?

05:29.879 --> 05:32.079
He hasn't even explained
the case to us yet,

05:32.319 --> 05:35.040
but now, he's talking
about family rules?

05:38.239 --> 05:39.460
I agree.

05:39.480 --> 05:42.240
After all, human lives are at stake.

05:43.400 --> 05:44.639
You have a point.

05:44.960 --> 05:47.800
Human lives are at stake,
and no concrete evidence has been found.

05:48.110 --> 05:49.639
Regarding the Fan family,

05:50.720 --> 05:52.440
we can talk about them later.

05:54.360 --> 05:55.480
Your Majesty,

05:56.639 --> 05:58.720
initially, I wanted to proceed
with the cases in accordance

05:58.720 --> 06:00.440
with their severity.

06:00.600 --> 06:03.020
However, it's fine for us
to talk about the murder.

06:03.040 --> 06:04.120
Mr. Fan.

06:04.879 --> 06:06.340
What are you after here?

06:06.360 --> 06:08.970
You're an inspector
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

06:08.990 --> 06:10.659
Why are you targeting your own superior?

06:10.679 --> 06:12.530
Of course I'm trying
to eradicate corruption here.

06:12.550 --> 06:13.940
Mr. Xin, if you practice corruption,

06:13.960 --> 06:15.519
I'll target you too.

06:17.030 --> 06:17.940
I was just joking.

06:17.960 --> 06:19.120
Let's enjoy the show.

06:21.400 --> 06:22.820
As all of you know,

06:22.840 --> 06:25.820
the three culprits
in Baoyue Pleasure House

06:25.840 --> 06:27.859
were arrested by
the Imperial Inspectorate.

06:27.879 --> 06:30.099
After that, the swordsman, Fan Wujiu,

06:30.119 --> 06:33.059
assassinated the culprits
outside the Capital Magistrate.

06:33.079 --> 06:37.500
According to investigation, the culprit
is Second Prince's retainer.

06:37.520 --> 06:39.619
I, Lai Mingcheng,

06:39.639 --> 06:43.120
accuse Second Prince
of silencing the witnesses!

06:55.110 --> 06:56.850
I wasn't strict with my subordinates.

06:56.870 --> 06:58.440
I trusted the wrong individuals.

06:59.360 --> 07:00.800
However, I'm unable to bear

07:00.800 --> 07:02.179
the charge of silencing the culprits.

07:02.199 --> 07:03.900
Fan Wujiu already
confessed to his crime.

07:03.920 --> 07:06.599
He was the one behind
all the evil deeds.

07:07.040 --> 07:09.159
I was duped by villains as well.

07:10.040 --> 07:11.560
It's too late for me to regret it.

07:19.319 --> 07:20.480
Mr. Lai,

07:20.559 --> 07:21.439
the law of Qing State

07:21.439 --> 07:24.560
emphasizes witness
and concrete evidence, right?

07:25.759 --> 07:26.959
That's right.

07:28.160 --> 07:29.240
Your Majesty,

07:29.840 --> 07:31.979
under your grace,
the Imperial Procuratorate

07:31.999 --> 07:34.560
is investigating
and eradicating corruption.

07:34.759 --> 07:36.780
Now, we have clues.

07:36.800 --> 07:39.820
After our thorough investigation,
we discovered the names

07:39.840 --> 07:43.959
of another 15 corrupt officials
from the previous name list.

07:48.559 --> 07:50.320
Your Majesty, please take a look.

08:01.170 --> 08:02.559
[[Name List of Corrupt Officials
in the Capital]

08:02.559 --> 08:03.619
Your Majesty,

08:03.639 --> 08:05.940
after Fan Xian
returned from Northern Qi,

08:05.960 --> 08:07.800
he once mentioned

08:07.879 --> 08:10.739
the smuggling case in Northern Qi
conducted by Second Prince

08:10.759 --> 08:12.859
and Eldest Princess.

08:12.879 --> 08:14.639
If it was true,

08:14.840 --> 08:17.460
where did the money
that they'd embezzled go to?

08:17.480 --> 08:19.299
These 15 officials

08:19.319 --> 08:22.460
have procured a huge sum
from unknown sources.

08:22.480 --> 08:25.859
And, all of them are
close to Second Prince.

08:25.879 --> 08:27.639
Now, I have a question.

08:27.840 --> 08:29.900
The money that you'd earned
from smuggling goods,

08:29.920 --> 08:32.339
did you spend them
on bribing the other officials,

08:32.359 --> 08:34.560
Second Prince?

08:41.000 --> 08:42.719
Such audacity!

08:47.079 --> 08:48.159
Your Majesty.

08:48.359 --> 08:50.380
I hereby request

08:50.400 --> 08:53.040
a thorough investigation

08:53.040 --> 08:55.820
of Second Prince and Eldest Princess's
smuggling case in Northern Qi.

09:09.800 --> 09:10.880
No.

09:12.240 --> 09:13.980
Your Majesty, please think twice!

09:14.000 --> 09:15.860
The smuggling case
contained no concrete evidence.

09:15.880 --> 09:17.719
They're purely speculations.

09:18.559 --> 09:21.839
The case will end here now.

09:29.319 --> 09:30.400
Your Majesty,

09:30.565 --> 09:33.286
maybe the evidence
is right in front of us.

09:33.959 --> 09:36.539
Fan Wujiu is Second Prince's retainer.

09:36.559 --> 09:38.179
If we interrogate him,

09:38.199 --> 09:41.220
firstly, we can find out the truth
behind the murder.

09:41.240 --> 09:44.380
Secondly, we can gather clues
related to the smuggling case.

09:44.400 --> 09:46.760
Your Majesty, please permit us!

10:45.719 --> 10:47.339
You must investigate the case!

10:47.359 --> 10:48.590
You're right! You have to investigate it!

10:48.599 --> 10:49.980
I support you wholeheartedly.

10:50.000 --> 10:51.400
As for the interrogation of Fan Wujiu,

10:51.400 --> 10:52.419
I'll support it as well.

10:52.439 --> 10:53.459
Mr. Lai, with you around,

10:53.479 --> 10:56.020
I'm sure we can get to the bottom
of Baoyue Pleasure House's murder.

10:56.040 --> 10:58.119
I'm sure you can prove my innocence!

11:10.000 --> 11:11.080
Your Majesty,

11:11.160 --> 11:13.440
I have one more thing to say.

11:13.479 --> 11:14.740
I cannot contain myself.

11:14.760 --> 11:15.840
Speak.

11:18.280 --> 11:20.250
Just now, Mr. Fan said

11:20.270 --> 11:21.939
Baoyue Pleasure House
has been sealed off.

11:21.959 --> 11:23.839
I was worried when I heard that.

11:24.230 --> 11:25.299
Within Baoyue Pleasure House

11:25.319 --> 11:27.339
are tens of courtesans and workers.

11:27.359 --> 11:29.220
They're the people of Qing as well.

11:29.240 --> 11:30.040
How will they survive

11:30.040 --> 11:31.740
after the closing
of Baoyue Pleasure House?

11:31.760 --> 11:33.220
Where should they go?

11:33.240 --> 11:34.339
In my opinion,

11:34.359 --> 11:35.839
the Fan family was the reason

11:35.959 --> 11:37.339
Baoyue Pleasure House was founded.

11:37.359 --> 11:40.939
The Fan family should take care of them.

11:40.959 --> 11:42.199
You have a point!

11:42.439 --> 11:44.539
I'll help them settle down.

11:44.559 --> 11:46.299
I have a question.
Will you still do the same business?

11:46.319 --> 11:47.900
Of course not. I won't turn it
into a brothel again.

11:47.920 --> 11:49.459
I'm glad to hear that.

11:49.479 --> 11:50.800
Li Chengze.

11:52.559 --> 11:53.639
Relay my order.

11:54.320 --> 11:56.659
You are to be placed
under house arrest for six months.

11:56.679 --> 11:58.599
- I...
- Reflect upon your actions.

12:05.240 --> 12:06.520
Yes, Your Majesty.

12:07.520 --> 12:08.800
Fan Jian, Fan Xian.

12:08.839 --> 12:09.959
Yes, Your Majesty.

12:11.390 --> 12:13.299
Six months' worth of salary
will be deducted from you two

12:13.319 --> 12:14.620
to serve as a warning for the rest.

12:14.640 --> 12:16.640
Yes, Your Majesty.

12:24.280 --> 12:25.400
Lai Mingcheng.

12:25.559 --> 12:26.699
Your Majesty!

12:26.719 --> 12:28.199
Mr. Lai.

12:29.920 --> 12:31.100
Are you happy now?

12:31.120 --> 12:32.239
Your Majesty.

12:33.000 --> 12:36.459
Fan Jian and his son have
damaged our reputation as officials.

12:36.479 --> 12:38.020
A mere salary deduction

12:38.040 --> 12:39.500
is too light of a punishment!

12:39.520 --> 12:41.320
People will not be convinced!

12:42.040 --> 12:43.820
What else do you want?

12:43.840 --> 12:45.140
Strip them of their titles!

12:45.160 --> 12:48.400
Although their family isn't strict
with their upbringing,

12:48.800 --> 12:50.740
I don't think we need to resort to that.

12:50.760 --> 12:51.999
Your Majesty,

12:52.240 --> 12:54.160
please think twice!

12:59.400 --> 13:03.780
Are you forcing me to change my order?

13:03.800 --> 13:05.459
I dare not do so.

13:05.479 --> 13:06.800
What do you dare not do?

13:06.959 --> 13:08.680
You dare do anything.

13:10.760 --> 13:13.000
Second Prince is already placed
under house arrest for six months.

13:13.000 --> 13:14.760
Even so, you're still not content.

13:19.760 --> 13:21.119
Enough already.

13:22.359 --> 13:26.400
The cases today already had conclusions.

13:31.640 --> 13:33.119
All of you are dismissed.

13:35.160 --> 13:36.280
Your Majesty,

13:36.520 --> 13:38.760
I'm not done yet.

13:40.319 --> 13:41.440
Your Majesty.

13:41.640 --> 13:43.999
I'm not done yet.

13:45.559 --> 13:46.639
Fine.

13:46.920 --> 13:48.400
Who will you target next?

13:48.559 --> 13:49.639
Your Majesty,

13:50.199 --> 13:54.119
my next target is Chen Pingping.

13:54.479 --> 13:56.419
Now, I'm not targeting corruption.

13:56.439 --> 13:58.620
I'm targeting the rules
that are unclear.

13:58.640 --> 14:01.860
I'm not just targeting Chen Pingping.

14:01.880 --> 14:05.079
I'm targeting
the entire Imperial Inspectorate.

14:05.760 --> 14:06.880
The Imperial Inspectorate?

14:06.880 --> 14:08.459
What is he doing?

14:08.479 --> 14:09.999
Has he lost his mind?

14:10.120 --> 14:10.959
He must've lost his mind.

14:10.959 --> 14:12.640
This is ridiculous!

14:15.839 --> 14:17.400
What is he doing?

14:17.959 --> 14:18.659
Your Majesty,

14:18.679 --> 14:20.699
ever since the Imperial Inspectorate
was founded,

14:20.719 --> 14:22.900
the people who worked there
were of mixed quality.

14:22.920 --> 14:25.860
And, they've acted erratically
and were rebellious.

14:25.880 --> 14:27.659
In court,

14:27.679 --> 14:28.980
beyond the borders,

14:29.000 --> 14:31.220
they're involved in everything.

14:31.240 --> 14:33.959
Their power rivals yours.

14:34.040 --> 14:35.020
Your Majesty,

14:35.040 --> 14:35.980
I have a question.

14:36.000 --> 14:37.620
Throughout history,

14:37.640 --> 14:39.800
is there any precedent for this?

14:40.040 --> 14:41.520
This is ridiculous!

14:42.400 --> 14:43.539
Your Majesty,

14:43.559 --> 14:45.339
Mr. Chen had spent a lot of effort

14:45.359 --> 14:47.250
to render all kinds of merits
for the state.

14:47.270 --> 14:48.900
Without the Imperial Inspectorate,

14:48.920 --> 14:51.160
the Qing State wouldn't be
as peaceful as it is.

14:51.400 --> 14:52.520
You!

14:52.679 --> 14:54.939
How dare you target
the Imperial Inspectorate?

14:54.959 --> 14:55.500
That's right.

14:55.520 --> 14:56.470
Even ancient practices

14:56.490 --> 14:58.040
might not be entirely correct.

14:59.000 --> 15:00.740
However, no matter
how colossal it may be,

15:00.760 --> 15:01.959
with all the affairs of the world,

15:01.959 --> 15:03.430
each department
shares the burden together!

15:03.439 --> 15:05.059
That's more than just
an ancient practice.

15:05.079 --> 15:06.760
That's common sense as well!

15:08.800 --> 15:09.920
Your Majesty,

15:10.120 --> 15:14.380
please hand the records
of the Imperial Inspectorate

15:14.400 --> 15:15.659
to the Six Ministries

15:15.679 --> 15:16.860
and let them handle it.

15:16.880 --> 15:18.199
Do you mean

15:18.199 --> 15:21.040
you want the Six Ministries
to handle more of their responsibilities?

15:21.599 --> 15:22.800
It's more than that.

15:23.040 --> 15:24.959
I want Chen Pingping to retire!

15:26.120 --> 15:27.400
What did he say?

15:37.120 --> 15:38.120
Such nonsense.

15:38.120 --> 15:39.640
What is he saying?

15:41.280 --> 15:45.119
The officials still think
that the Imperial Inspectorate

15:45.280 --> 15:46.980
has more pros than cons.

15:47.000 --> 15:50.040
That means there's confusion
within the Six Ministries.

15:56.160 --> 15:57.479
Mr. Lai,

15:58.800 --> 16:01.059
the Imperial Inspectorate

16:01.079 --> 16:03.199
did contribute a lot
to the state all these years.

16:03.200 --> 16:04.679
However, the rules
that govern it are unclear.

16:04.679 --> 16:06.620
It might spell endless trouble.

16:06.640 --> 16:07.720
Your Majesty,

16:07.800 --> 16:11.579
is Chen Pingping still under
the jurisdiction of law?

16:11.599 --> 16:14.800
Are you saying
that everyone in the world is drunk

16:14.839 --> 16:16.640
and that you're
the only sober person around?

16:16.640 --> 16:19.320
Your Majesty, please think twice.

16:25.280 --> 16:27.079
Has he ever been this bold?

16:27.199 --> 16:28.939
You see, Mr. Lai

16:28.959 --> 16:31.179
always targets everyone he sees.

16:31.199 --> 16:34.320
His Majesty can't
say anything about it either.

16:35.479 --> 16:36.900
Enough.

16:36.920 --> 16:40.239
The affairs of Imperial Inspectorate
cannot be decided in one day.

16:42.319 --> 16:43.920
I'm a little tired now.

16:44.000 --> 16:45.659
That's all for today.

16:45.679 --> 16:48.560
Your Majesty, I'm not done yet.

16:51.479 --> 16:52.559
Fine.

16:53.240 --> 16:55.780
Who else will you target?

16:55.800 --> 16:56.880
Your Majesty,

16:59.319 --> 17:00.959
this is the last one.

17:04.280 --> 17:05.220
Speak.

17:05.240 --> 17:06.059
Your Majesty,

17:06.079 --> 17:08.420
the Imperial Inspectorate
is above the Six Ministries.

17:08.440 --> 17:09.940
The obscure personnel decisions

17:09.960 --> 17:11.619
are just superficial issues.

17:11.639 --> 17:13.940
As the saying goes,
rectify the issue by purifying the roots.

17:13.960 --> 17:16.819
The officials are responsible
for the imperial court's errors.

17:16.839 --> 17:18.859
However, that doesn't
address the root issue.

17:18.879 --> 17:20.420
As the saying goes,

17:20.440 --> 17:23.159
fish begins to stink at the head.

17:23.200 --> 17:26.000
The last person I will target is...

17:27.879 --> 17:29.760
He is...

17:33.879 --> 17:37.079
Tell me. Say it with courage.

17:38.960 --> 17:40.839
It's you, Your Majesty.

17:41.879 --> 17:43.560
Such heresy!

17:44.040 --> 17:45.879
How dare you target His Majesty?

17:49.319 --> 17:51.439
He has lost his mind.

17:52.359 --> 17:54.040
He has lost his mind indeed.

18:07.639 --> 18:08.839
Your Majesty,

18:09.319 --> 18:11.200
to err is human.

18:11.480 --> 18:13.220
Who can be without faults?

18:13.240 --> 18:16.040
Those who make mistakes without knowing
are lacking in wisdom.

18:16.359 --> 18:19.760
Those who don't change
are lacking in courage.

18:20.119 --> 18:23.619
The foundation of Qing State
isn't the Imperial Inspectorate.

18:23.639 --> 18:25.299
It's the civil and military officials.

18:25.319 --> 18:27.480
It's the conscience of the world!

18:27.800 --> 18:28.880
Your Majesty,

18:29.000 --> 18:32.119
it's not too late for you to turn back!

18:33.359 --> 18:35.200
Everyone in the world was wrong.

18:35.200 --> 18:38.599
The Six Ministries and all officials
were blind as well.

18:40.480 --> 18:42.639
Have you guys heard him?

18:42.720 --> 18:45.200
Mr. Lai was saying

18:45.800 --> 18:48.359
that you all weren't the only ones
who were in the wrong here.

18:48.359 --> 18:51.280
I was in the wrong as well.

18:52.000 --> 18:53.700
Such audacity!

18:53.720 --> 18:55.299
He and his misleading words!

18:55.319 --> 18:57.639
How could you say that?

18:58.800 --> 19:02.260
Your Majesty, you're heroic
and exceptionally talented.

19:02.280 --> 19:04.500
But humans aren't perfect.

19:04.520 --> 19:08.059
How can I, as a subject, know of a wrong
and not advise against it?

19:08.079 --> 19:09.480
Your Majesty!

19:09.960 --> 19:11.819
Lai Mingcheng tried to target you!

19:11.839 --> 19:12.940
He has no respect for the ruler!

19:12.960 --> 19:15.379
He's arrogant beyond redemption!

19:15.399 --> 19:16.560
He's...

19:18.040 --> 19:20.639
He's literally an animal!

19:57.919 --> 19:59.439
Your Majesty!

20:00.800 --> 20:04.639
I can't stand it anymore!

20:05.280 --> 20:08.079
Your Majesty,
you work tirelessly every day

20:08.079 --> 20:11.639
all for the prosperity
and peace of our state.

20:11.639 --> 20:12.960
But this person!

20:13.760 --> 20:16.420
How dare he insult you as such?

20:16.440 --> 20:17.339
My...

20:17.359 --> 20:18.439
My...

20:18.839 --> 20:21.780
My heart is aching!

20:21.800 --> 20:23.520
Your Majesty!

20:24.240 --> 20:25.960
Your Majesty!

20:26.280 --> 20:28.139
Your Majesty!
Your grace shines more brilliantly

20:28.159 --> 20:29.700
than the Sun and the Moon!

20:29.720 --> 20:30.859
Your Majesty, your grace

20:30.879 --> 20:32.220
is like that of my parents!

20:32.240 --> 20:33.899
Your Majesty, an insult to you

20:33.919 --> 20:37.819
is worse than torture
inflicted upon my body!

20:37.839 --> 20:40.599
My heart is aching!

20:43.000 --> 20:44.859
My... My heart is aching too!

20:44.879 --> 20:46.119
Enough!

20:48.240 --> 20:49.099
Your Majesty!

20:49.119 --> 20:51.180
Although Lai Mingcheng was very rude,

20:51.200 --> 20:52.639
as one of the censors,

20:52.639 --> 20:53.700
it was his duty to do so.

20:53.720 --> 20:55.460
Your Majesty, please pardon his crime

20:55.480 --> 20:57.599
and let him serve the state.

20:57.680 --> 20:59.120
That's what I thought as well.

20:59.140 --> 21:00.899
Although Lai Mingcheng
acted ridiculously,

21:00.919 --> 21:02.780
Your Majesty's magnanimity
knows no bounds.

21:02.800 --> 21:04.780
I'm sure you wouldn't
take his words to heart.

21:04.800 --> 21:08.800
Reprimanding him would be enough.

21:08.879 --> 21:10.240
I've heard and seen

21:10.240 --> 21:13.399
all of your efforts.

21:14.359 --> 21:15.560
Mr. Chen.

21:16.000 --> 21:17.080
Your Majesty.

21:17.200 --> 21:19.240
I was impeached as well.

21:19.390 --> 21:21.119
I have no right to comment on this.

21:21.280 --> 21:22.520
General Qin.

21:24.800 --> 21:26.020
Yes, Your Majesty.

21:26.040 --> 21:26.780
Your Majesty,

21:26.800 --> 21:29.320
Lai Mingcheng was confused.

21:29.340 --> 21:31.819
The Imperial Inspectorate has
made major contributions to the state.

21:31.839 --> 21:35.720
He doesn't understand your pain at all.

21:35.919 --> 21:37.760
He should be

21:38.919 --> 21:40.280
demoted!

21:41.040 --> 21:42.399
Prime Minister Lin?

21:46.680 --> 21:48.760
Your Majesty, I think

21:48.879 --> 21:50.800
everyone is right.

21:52.879 --> 21:54.299
Everyone is right?

21:54.319 --> 21:56.379
Although Lai Mingcheng has committed

21:56.399 --> 21:57.940
an unpardonable crime,

21:57.960 --> 22:01.139
Your Majesty, your grace
is known by all.

22:01.159 --> 22:03.919
Both execution and punishment
make perfect sense.

22:04.119 --> 22:07.919
Your Majesty, it depends on you
whether you want to use him or not.

22:08.000 --> 22:11.599
After much consideration,

22:11.720 --> 22:14.399
I still think that he should be punished

22:14.919 --> 22:16.720
for offending you, Your Majesty.

22:17.000 --> 22:21.599
However, Your Majesty,
you should decide his punishment.

22:22.200 --> 22:23.639
In my opinion,

22:24.839 --> 22:26.399
Lai Mingcheng

22:26.680 --> 22:28.399
did a great job.

22:29.079 --> 22:30.960
He did a great job indeed.

22:31.119 --> 22:32.940
He spoke frankly and offered advice.

22:32.960 --> 22:36.720
He does live up to his name
as the top censor of the state.

22:36.740 --> 22:37.840
He has national affairs at heart

22:37.860 --> 22:39.270
without considering
his personal interests.

22:39.280 --> 22:43.480
All the officials should learn from him.

22:43.919 --> 22:46.660
Seems like I cannot punish him.

22:46.680 --> 22:48.639
I need to reward him instead.

22:55.000 --> 22:57.720
Why are you not done yet?

22:58.159 --> 22:59.239
Your Majesty,

22:59.680 --> 23:03.099
I feel heartbroken yet sentimental.

23:03.119 --> 23:04.439
I was in pain

23:04.720 --> 23:06.560
when he targeted you, Your Majesty.

23:06.879 --> 23:10.899
However, we do have
a clear and just official like Mr. Lai.

23:10.919 --> 23:13.280
That's why I'm filled with emotions.

23:13.440 --> 23:15.139
At this moment,

23:15.159 --> 23:17.980
I'm filled with mixed feelings.

23:18.000 --> 23:20.599
I don't know
whether I should laugh or cry.

23:26.319 --> 23:27.439
Enough.

23:30.319 --> 23:32.359
I'm considering it.

23:35.839 --> 23:38.200
I'm considering what to reward him with.

23:43.839 --> 23:45.040
Your Majesty,

23:45.240 --> 23:46.500
the rewards are here.

23:46.520 --> 23:49.130
What about the accessories
Fan Xian impeached me of?

23:49.150 --> 23:50.839
Mr. Chen, you're looking
at the smaller picture here.

23:50.839 --> 23:53.139
He's the censor of Qing State.

23:53.159 --> 23:56.079
Why would he lust after wealth?

23:58.950 --> 24:00.180
Prime Minister Lin.

24:00.200 --> 24:01.180
Your Majesty.

24:01.200 --> 24:02.879
What did all censors pursue

24:03.159 --> 24:07.420
since ancient times?

24:07.440 --> 24:10.119
Censors offered frank advice
to their rulers.

24:10.440 --> 24:14.299
They only seek to have their names
remembered in history.

24:14.319 --> 24:16.439
Have their names
remembered in history, huh?

24:18.390 --> 24:19.800
You mean flogging him?

24:26.599 --> 24:30.780
Flogging him will make people
remember him throughout history.

24:30.800 --> 24:32.619
Your Majesty, please think twice.

24:32.639 --> 24:35.599
In historical records, rulers
who bestowed the act of flogging

24:36.040 --> 24:38.560
may have had their reservations.

24:40.839 --> 24:48.839
I know that the historians won't write
good things about me if I flog the censor.

24:50.960 --> 24:52.839
If so, I shall incur loss

24:53.280 --> 24:54.800
and fulfill his wish.

25:00.040 --> 25:01.200
Everyone.

25:02.280 --> 25:04.079
You all better learn from him.

25:05.559 --> 25:08.500
Your Majesty, you weren't mistaken!
I was mistaken!

25:08.520 --> 25:09.679
Your Majesty!

25:09.800 --> 25:12.560
Mr. Lai did render merit
in eradicating corruption after all!

25:12.879 --> 25:14.619
You're so protective of him, huh?

25:14.639 --> 25:15.719
Fine.

25:16.919 --> 25:19.399
You shall supervise his punishment.

25:31.000 --> 25:33.919
Fan Xian, His Majesty
already issued an order.

25:40.480 --> 25:41.720
Yes,

25:42.319 --> 25:43.839
Your Majesty!

25:57.760 --> 25:58.500
Where's Eunuch Hou?

25:58.520 --> 25:59.500
Where's Lai Mingcheng?

25:59.520 --> 26:00.600
I don't know.

26:05.960 --> 26:06.819
Where's Eunuch Hou?

26:06.839 --> 26:08.099
Where's Lai Mingcheng?

26:08.119 --> 26:09.199
I don't know.

26:09.359 --> 26:10.439
I don't know.

26:18.800 --> 26:20.700
I, Fan Xian, am tasked
to supervise the punishment!

26:20.720 --> 26:23.159
Where is Lai Mingcheng
being flogged right now?

26:35.639 --> 26:36.819
Where's Eunuch Hou?

26:36.839 --> 26:38.200
Where's Lai Mingcheng?

27:00.919 --> 27:02.500
Mr. Fan,

27:02.520 --> 27:04.560
what are you doing here?

27:07.840 --> 27:10.200
His Majesty instructed me
to supervise the punishment.

27:11.240 --> 27:12.359
No need for that.

27:17.040 --> 27:18.919
How many more rods
does he have to receive?

27:20.639 --> 27:23.119
Did His Majesty instruct you
to do anything else

27:23.359 --> 27:25.639
besides supervising the punishment?

27:29.280 --> 27:30.360
No, he didn't.

27:32.200 --> 27:34.520
That means he doesn't plan on stopping.

27:35.839 --> 27:36.580
Stop flogging him!

27:36.600 --> 27:38.350
I'll go and ask His Majesty about it!

27:38.720 --> 27:40.159
Mr. Fan!

27:40.599 --> 27:42.679
It's already too late.

29:14.810 --> 29:17.220
Mr. Fan, we've arrived
at the Imperial Inspectorate.

29:17.240 --> 29:18.980
I think Mr. Chen is waiting for you.

29:19.000 --> 29:20.679
I don't wish to see anyone right now.

30:00.040 --> 30:02.320
You've never been to this room before.

30:02.800 --> 30:05.040
Not many people can visit this room.

30:05.319 --> 30:08.099
This treasure over here
connects all eight divisions.

30:08.119 --> 30:09.510
The secret keys of all eight divisions

30:09.530 --> 30:10.280
will be delivered here

30:10.280 --> 30:13.119
at the first time
regardless of their sizes.

30:13.440 --> 30:15.879
Each division is marked by
a different color.

30:18.839 --> 30:19.720
I can relay my secret order

30:19.720 --> 30:21.760
immediately from this very area.

30:30.040 --> 30:33.439
Your mother left behind
this treasure for me.

30:49.839 --> 30:50.919
What's wrong?

30:52.200 --> 30:53.679
Are you in a bad mood?

30:58.079 --> 30:59.760
I don't understand.

31:00.079 --> 31:04.040
Why did he flog Lai Mingcheng to death?

31:05.040 --> 31:06.020
Didn't you say

31:06.040 --> 31:08.460
that you were fine when you reprimanded
His Majesty while pointing at him?

31:08.480 --> 31:10.520
His Majesty is magnanimous.

31:11.399 --> 31:13.619
Not only will you not be in trouble
for doing so,

31:13.639 --> 31:15.859
but His Majesty will
laugh it off as well.

31:15.879 --> 31:18.180
If so, why did he flog
Lai Mingcheng to death?

31:18.200 --> 31:20.639
His Majesty is fine with Lai Mingcheng
targeting him.

31:21.200 --> 31:23.480
However, no one must touch
his bottom line.

31:23.850 --> 31:25.680
Is the Imperial Inspectorate
His Majesty's bottom line?

31:25.680 --> 31:29.480
The restoration of Qing State
is His Majesty's bottom line.

31:31.280 --> 31:32.960
If so,

31:33.180 --> 31:34.859
could it be that all those
who dared to impeach

31:34.879 --> 31:37.220
the Imperial Inspectorate all died?

31:37.240 --> 31:39.299
There were plenty of censors
who did the same.

31:39.319 --> 31:41.299
But Lai Mingcheng is the first one
to be flogged to death.

31:41.319 --> 31:42.720
What's the difference between him

31:42.720 --> 31:43.940
and the others, then?

31:43.960 --> 31:45.890
Did Lai Mingcheng find you before this?

31:46.760 --> 31:47.399
He did.

31:47.399 --> 31:48.820
Did you two investigate
the case together?

31:48.820 --> 31:50.280
It's not a secret
for the Imperial Procuratorate

31:50.280 --> 31:52.760
to retrieve some case files
for their case investigation.

31:55.710 --> 31:57.350
Did His Majesty flog him to death
because of that?

31:57.359 --> 32:00.539
The Imperial Inspectorate is
independent of the Six Ministries

32:00.559 --> 32:03.560
to prevent people
from overstretching their reach.

32:06.040 --> 32:07.599
I shouldn't have promised him.

32:10.639 --> 32:12.439
I was the reason he died.

32:12.720 --> 32:13.839
It's not you.

32:15.000 --> 32:17.240
Your answer doesn't matter.

32:18.599 --> 32:20.359
When Lai Mingcheng chose

32:20.359 --> 32:21.619
to approach you,

32:21.639 --> 32:23.919
that was the end of his life.

32:24.079 --> 32:25.439
Him approaching me

32:26.359 --> 32:28.040
was the cause of his death?

32:33.919 --> 32:35.480
Think deeper.

32:36.040 --> 32:38.720
Why did His Majesty instruct you
to supervise the punishment?

32:43.680 --> 32:46.020
Do you still admire Lai Mingcheng?

32:46.040 --> 32:47.219
I do.

32:47.480 --> 32:48.760
Did you know?

32:49.190 --> 32:51.139
When the censors
in the Imperial Procuratorate

32:51.159 --> 32:52.839
were collecting Lai Mingcheng's body,

32:52.839 --> 32:56.040
they hated you to the core.

32:56.520 --> 32:58.159
From today onward,

32:58.480 --> 33:00.379
no one in the Imperial Procuratorate

33:00.399 --> 33:02.560
will be your ally.

33:05.910 --> 33:08.040
You have to take over
the Imperial Treasury.

33:08.520 --> 33:11.159
You have to take over
the Imperial Inspectorate.

33:12.800 --> 33:15.159
An official with
such heavy responsibilities

33:15.879 --> 33:17.720
is unprecedented throughout history.

33:21.131 --> 33:24.131
I can only be a lone official.

33:24.960 --> 33:27.000
The ruler's power is unfathomable.

33:27.240 --> 33:29.420
His intentions are
as deep as the abyss.

33:29.440 --> 33:30.879
Remember

33:31.240 --> 33:32.520
these two sentences.

33:33.033 --> 33:34.993
Allying with the Imperial Inspectorate,

33:35.520 --> 33:37.679
impeaching the Imperial Inspectorate,

33:38.280 --> 33:40.020
and finding me,

33:40.040 --> 33:41.879
those are the causes of his death?

33:52.319 --> 33:54.159
Our emperor

33:54.760 --> 33:56.599
cannot accept it

33:57.200 --> 33:59.839
when someone slips out of his control.

34:01.440 --> 34:02.780
But I don't understand.

34:02.800 --> 34:05.000
No matter if it's the law of the state
or the Imperial Inspectorate,

34:05.000 --> 34:07.359
weren't they established
for the sake of the people?

34:08.479 --> 34:11.039
Between the people and the emperor,
who's more important?

34:11.120 --> 34:12.839
You must bury these words

34:12.839 --> 34:13.959
deep inside your heart.

34:13.959 --> 34:15.800
Do not ever utter them again!

34:23.640 --> 34:25.039
I know the answer now.

34:27.280 --> 34:28.640
I won't ask it a second time.

34:34.319 --> 34:35.919
There are always people

34:36.560 --> 34:38.919
who will travel on a different path
from His Majesty.

34:42.519 --> 34:43.760
Is it my mother?

34:45.519 --> 34:46.919
She's dead.

34:49.600 --> 34:50.680
Yes.

34:56.039 --> 34:58.039
Your mother is already dead.

35:01.800 --> 35:03.720
But the path is always there.

35:07.680 --> 35:08.919
You should go home.

35:10.359 --> 35:12.080
You're drenched.

35:12.280 --> 35:13.680
Go and get changed.

35:14.879 --> 35:16.760
Warm yourself up.

36:40.200 --> 36:41.359
Xian?

36:42.319 --> 36:43.600
There's no rush in studying.

36:43.600 --> 36:44.760
You should take a break
when you're tired.

36:44.760 --> 36:46.060
That won't do.

36:46.080 --> 36:47.620
I haven't memorized all of them yet.

36:47.640 --> 36:49.620
I think these are my books, right?

36:49.640 --> 36:51.819
Yeah. All of these
are your medical books.

36:51.839 --> 36:53.460
I was wondering
where all of my books went.

36:53.480 --> 36:55.060
What's with the sudden mood
to study medicine?

36:55.080 --> 36:56.019
I want to help you out.

36:56.039 --> 36:57.119
Help me out?

36:58.479 --> 36:59.620
When Father pretended to be sick,

36:59.640 --> 37:01.939
we managed to avoid trouble
all thanks to your poison.

37:01.959 --> 37:03.220
After that, I inquired about it.

37:03.240 --> 37:05.060
Toxicology is a branch in the medical field.

37:05.080 --> 37:06.379
Therefore, I'm studying medicine.

37:06.399 --> 37:07.839
If we need to pretend to be sick

37:07.839 --> 37:08.580
and you're not home,

37:08.600 --> 37:10.010
at least I can do it myself.

37:11.479 --> 37:12.620
Learning medicine is tough.

37:12.640 --> 37:13.459
I'm not afraid.

37:13.479 --> 37:15.459
I've memorized half of them.

37:15.479 --> 37:16.999
There's no rush.

37:17.680 --> 37:19.500
Xian, why don't you test me?

37:19.520 --> 37:20.170
No need for that.

37:20.190 --> 37:21.419
You can get back to your memorizing.

37:21.439 --> 37:22.940
I'll just hang out for a while.

37:35.280 --> 37:36.360
Xian?

37:38.120 --> 37:39.359
Are you okay?

37:40.879 --> 37:41.999
I'm fine.

37:42.080 --> 37:43.640
I just feel troubled.

37:43.680 --> 37:45.200
I want to seek some solace here.

37:46.800 --> 37:48.250
Why don't you tell me about it?

37:48.270 --> 37:49.912
There's nothing I can share with you.

37:50.200 --> 37:52.120
It's just stupid palace affairs.

37:56.160 --> 37:57.240
Xian,

37:57.519 --> 37:59.760
why don't you quit being an official?

38:01.359 --> 38:02.559
What should I do, then?

38:02.600 --> 38:04.080
Anything else is fine.

38:04.200 --> 38:06.620
Traveling every day seems fun.

38:06.640 --> 38:07.899
What if I run out of money?

38:07.919 --> 38:09.090
I can support you.

38:09.110 --> 38:10.610
I'm learning medicine right now.

38:10.630 --> 38:11.660
I've already inquired about it.

38:11.680 --> 38:12.960
Physicians make a lot of money.

38:12.980 --> 38:14.060
You want to support me?

38:14.080 --> 38:15.740
Yeah. And Wan'er too.

38:15.760 --> 38:16.800
I'll support both of you.

38:16.800 --> 38:18.100
You're just saying that
to make me happy.

38:18.120 --> 38:19.399
I'm serious.

38:21.600 --> 38:23.280
I'm truly serious.

38:29.319 --> 38:30.399
Okay.

38:31.240 --> 38:32.919
If, one day,

38:32.999 --> 38:35.919
I do become desperate
and have nowhere to go,

38:36.560 --> 38:37.819
I'll be depending on you.

38:37.839 --> 38:39.439
That day won't arrive.

38:39.680 --> 38:41.120
But if it does happen,

38:41.399 --> 38:42.559
I'll protect you.

38:44.600 --> 38:45.879
It's a promise, then.

38:46.080 --> 38:47.680
Only dogs break their promises.

38:49.919 --> 38:52.140
Memorizing books isn't the way
to master medicine.

38:52.160 --> 38:54.120
Wait here. I'll find something for you.

38:55.675 --> 38:58.395
[Fan's Residence]

39:02.230 --> 39:04.710
To learn medicine, you must first
accept the sight of blood.

39:12.879 --> 39:14.339
Firstly, cut open its abdomen.

39:14.359 --> 39:15.800
After that, suture the wound.

39:19.879 --> 39:20.519
With this?

39:20.520 --> 39:21.700
It's much better than what I used.

39:21.720 --> 39:22.960
I did it with human bodies

39:22.980 --> 39:24.640
when my master taught me back then.

39:24.999 --> 39:26.710
Did you do it while they were alive?

39:26.879 --> 39:28.680
Doesn't that hurt too much?

39:30.319 --> 39:30.879
Chloroform.

39:30.880 --> 39:32.420
It's a special anesthesia
created by the Third Division.

39:32.439 --> 39:33.980
The patient won't feel anything.

39:38.125 --> 39:42.039
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

39:42.039 --> 39:42.999
Everyone, look closely.

39:42.999 --> 39:43.999
[Indenture]

39:43.999 --> 39:46.240
These are your indentures.

39:46.800 --> 39:48.499
Those are our indentures indeed.

39:48.519 --> 39:49.879
Why does he have it?

39:49.879 --> 39:51.180
I don't know.

39:51.200 --> 39:54.510
From now on, you all will only
sell your crafts for a living.

39:54.680 --> 39:56.499
However, you're free now.

39:56.519 --> 39:57.859
Free?

39:57.879 --> 39:59.439
We're free?

40:02.359 --> 40:04.640
We're only selling our crafts
for a living?

40:06.800 --> 40:08.919
If so, will people still be our patrons?

40:10.280 --> 40:11.399
Indeed.

40:12.080 --> 40:14.080
From now on,
the future is unpredictable.

40:14.280 --> 40:17.479
That's why Mr. Fan is allowing you all
to leave or stay as you please.

40:19.039 --> 40:21.839
If so, may we leave now?

40:21.879 --> 40:23.039
Of course.

40:23.200 --> 40:24.300
Please.

40:28.240 --> 40:29.519
Are we truly leaving?

40:32.680 --> 40:34.299
What about us, then?

40:34.319 --> 40:35.740
We have nothing left anyway. Let's go.

40:35.760 --> 40:36.979
Let's go.

40:36.999 --> 40:39.859
Mr. Fan could've ordered us to stay.

40:39.879 --> 40:42.359
There was no need for us
to make our own decisions.

40:42.800 --> 40:44.979
Our fates were always
in the hands of others.

40:44.999 --> 40:46.559
We were already used to it.

40:47.200 --> 40:49.919
He said he didn't like that.

40:51.999 --> 40:53.879
Mr. Fan even said

40:54.839 --> 40:58.039
that you all should
decide your own fates.

40:58.439 --> 41:00.200
Decide our own fates?

41:01.640 --> 41:03.280
I wish to stay here and give it a try.

41:03.839 --> 41:04.919
All right.

41:05.359 --> 41:08.400
Let's welcome Miss Sang Wen
to Baoyue Pleasure House.

41:08.400 --> 41:08.439
I wish to stay
and give it a try as well!
Let's welcome Miss Sang Wen
to Baoyue Pleasure House.

41:08.439 --> 41:10.019
I wish to stay
and give it a try as well!

41:10.039 --> 41:12.350
I wish to stay
and give it a try as well!

41:12.359 --> 41:14.260
It's the first time
I'm deciding my own fate.

41:14.280 --> 41:16.220
We're willing to believe Mr. Fan!

41:16.240 --> 41:20.919
We're willing to stay!

41:27.319 --> 41:28.700
Feather duster for sale.

41:28.720 --> 41:30.080
Perfumed sachet for sale.

41:30.080 --> 41:32.120
Take a look. Feather duster for sale.

41:32.120 --> 41:33.339
We sell everything you need.

41:33.359 --> 41:34.999
Come and take a look.

41:44.240 --> 41:47.240
Fresh mutton soup for sale.

41:47.760 --> 41:49.220
Sir, give it a try.

41:49.240 --> 41:51.540
Our mutton soup is fresh.

41:51.560 --> 41:53.080
All right. I want a bowl.

42:01.640 --> 42:02.720
Mr. Fan,

42:03.080 --> 42:04.959
something seems off.

42:11.360 --> 42:12.760
They're here to stop me.

42:13.080 --> 42:15.039
Why don't we take a detour?

42:15.039 --> 42:16.420
Continue forward.

42:16.440 --> 42:18.879
Since they're already here,
there's no need to avoid them.

42:22.200 --> 42:23.280
All right.

42:26.439 --> 42:27.160
Take a look.

42:27.160 --> 42:28.959
Come and take a look.

42:36.399 --> 42:37.559
Make way!

42:37.680 --> 42:38.660
Get out of the way!

42:38.680 --> 42:39.299
Make way!

42:39.319 --> 42:39.700
Run!

42:39.720 --> 42:40.920
Get out of the way!

42:44.439 --> 42:45.540
Who's that?

42:45.560 --> 42:47.959
The one sitting inside,
you better show yourself!

42:50.160 --> 42:51.359
Mr. Fan,

42:51.519 --> 42:53.979
these youngsters have
quite the background.

42:53.999 --> 42:57.439
Their fathers are either
dukes or marquises.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.153 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
